title: "Kaplan–Meier survival curves in Python with canvasxpress"
description: "Turn a survival table into an interactive, reproducible Kaplan–Meier plot stratified by treatment arm — with censoring ticks — in a few lines of Python."
author: "Isaac Neuhaus"
